WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You turned the page. Do you remember the paragraph?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sometimes we keep reading after our attention has gone elsewhere.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers ask when we noticed our mind had wandered.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A spontaneous catch and an unexpected question reveal different things.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve free minutes: notice, mark, return. It's not a diagnosis.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
A useful routine needs no miracle. Read the evidence, then decide.
